# Normalize line endings: store text as LF in the repo and check it out as LF on every platform.
# Without this, Windows runners (core.autocrlf=true) check files out as CRLF, which Biome's
# `lineEnding: "lf"` formatter then flags as "File content differs from formatting output".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
